participants: Service, Database, Relay, Broker
Service -> Database: BEGIN: insert order + insert outbox row
Database --> Service: COMMIT (both or neither)
Relay -> Database: read unpublished outbox rows
Relay -> Broker: publish OrderPlaced
Broker --> Relay: ack
Relay -> Database: mark row as sent
note over Relay, Broker: crash before 'mark sent'? the event is published again, so consumers deduplicate
